7. FUNCTIONALITY FIRST

This is important.

Do not produce beautiful static mockups with dead buttons.

Inspect the current Project implementation, routes, state, APIs and backend capabilities first.

Connect every UI action to the existing real functionality wherever it already exists.

Test:

* navigation
* create
* open
* edit
* save
* delete
* completion
* upload/import
* error states
* empty states

If something requires backend functionality that genuinely does not exist, do NOT fake it.

Clearly report it instead.

