9. IOS DETAILS

Pay particular attention to:

* Dynamic Island / safe areas
* keyboard avoidance
* scroll insets
* native sheets
* native menus
* swipe actions where appropriate
* context menus where appropriate
* loading states
* pull-to-refresh only if useful
* accessibility/touch targets
* long filenames/text
* Arabic RTL
* Swedish/English LTR

